{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_01",
      "hash": "1e444fd644369518",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：喔～！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]、[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_08",
      "hash": "1e4448d644368933",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看来你们两个\\n多多少少都成长了不少啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_09",
      "hash": "1e4447d644368780",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正好正好！\\n向你们两个介绍一下。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_02",
      "hash": "1e4452d644369a31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这是我的孙子。\\c\\n……呃，\\n他是叫什么名字来着？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_01",
      "hash": "730cd52049366e82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：爷爷，都这个年代了，\\n您怎么还在开那个玩笑啊！\\c\\n而且，\\n我们其实早就认识了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_03",
      "hash": "1e4451d64436987e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：哎唷，真是扫兴……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_02",
      "hash": "730cd42049366ccf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：好了好了……\\n比起这个……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_03",
      "hash": "730cd32049366b1c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\n你们真是了不起啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_01",
      "hash": "c376b6a23bef83a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：嗯？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_04",
      "hash": "730cd22049366969",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：火箭队那件事啦！\\c\\n真是没想到，\\n当时火箭队的老大\\r\\n居然会在西尔佛公司！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_11",
      "hash": "730951204933585f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是你们两个\\n把火箭队打倒的吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_02",
      "hash": "c376b7a23bef8556",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：打倒老大坂木\\n是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]一个人的功劳……！\\c\\n我只是稍微\\n帮了一点忙而已……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1210_select_01",
      "hash": "565fe7f2f2508995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1210_select_02",
      "hash": "565fe4f2f250847c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_03",
      "hash": "c376b8a23bef8709",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_05",
      "hash": "730cd120493667b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：没关系啦！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]也很努力了啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_06",
      "hash": "730cd02049366603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了好了！\\n好好表扬你们两个！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1210_red_01",
      "hash": "3728b40d3f0093c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_07",
      "hash": "730ccf2049366450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1210_red_02",
      "hash": "3728b30d3f00920f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_01",
      "hash": "a381c93f1818b354",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从青绿那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]钥石[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_04",
      "hash": "1e4454d644369d97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：喔～！\\n这不是钥石嘛！\\c\\n这是用来启动超越了进化的进化……\\n也就是[VAR COLOR(0006)]超级进化[VAR COLOR(0000)]的宝石！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_04",
      "hash": "c376b9a23bef88bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：超级进化！？\\n那是什么……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_05",
      "hash": "1e4453d644369be4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了钥石和[VAR COLOR(0006)]超级石[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n这两种宝石……\\c\\n便能使宝可梦在对战中\\n启动一次[VAR COLOR(0006)]超级进化[VAR COLOR(0000)]！只有一次喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_10",
      "hash": "1e414ad6443456c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在这时宝可梦会为了训练家\\n大幅提升自己的威力！\\c\\n这也就是宝可梦和训练家之间\\n存在着深厚[VAR COLOR(0006)]牵绊[VAR COLOR(0000)]的证明！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_06",
      "hash": "1e4456d64436a0fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在此作诗一首：\\c\\n两颗小石头，\\n加上伙伴一条心，\\r\\n超级大进化……"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_08",
      "hash": "730cde2049367dcd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：以你们两个的实力，\\n应该可以运用自如的。\\c\\n这就是超级石了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_02",
      "hash": "a381cc3f1818b86d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]妙蛙花进化石[VAR COLOR(0000)]、[VAR COLOR(0006)]喷火龙进化石Ｘ[VAR COLOR(0000)]、\\r\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]喷火龙进化石Ｙ[VAR COLOR(0000)]和[VAR COLOR(0006)]水箭龟进化石[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_09",
      "hash": "730cdd2049367c1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你们不是要去宝可梦联盟嘛！\\n既然这样就用用看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_10",
      "hash": "73095020493356ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：话说回来，\\n你们为什么会来这里？\\c\\n……什么？\\n你说常青道馆的馆主一直不在？\\c\\n确实有点诡异……\\n看来我今后也得去看一看了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_07",
      "hash": "1e4455d644369f4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：你们离宝可梦联盟\\n还差最后一步喽！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_03",
      "hash": "a381cb3f1818b6ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 31]"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_05",
      "hash": "c376baa23bef8a6f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：超级进化……\\n要是火箭队那些家伙用了这个，\\r\\n那后果一定不堪设想。"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main1210_assistant_01",
      "hash": "11a18db531ef6a17",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "除此之外，\\n还有其他种类的超级石存在。"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_main1210_assistant_02",
      "hash": "11a18eb531ef6bca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在关都地区，\\n超级进化可是非常罕见的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_main1210_adultf_01",
      "hash": "7131c42ffb65a163",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真新镇虽然面积不大，\\n却能孕育出这么多优秀的训练家，\\r\\n博士也一定很高兴吧。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1210_max",
      "hash": "f1b40d4267e13d51"
    }
  ]
}
